    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to bring to the market this well-presented first floor two bedroom apartment in the ever-popular Northwood development, known for its beautifully kept communal gardens. This is a great option for first-time buyers, investors, or anyone looking to downsize. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with a welcoming entrance hallway leading into a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, providing an ideal setting for both relaxing and entertaining. Large floor-to-ceiling doors open directly onto the balcony, allowing plenty of natural light into the living space. The fully fitted kitchen offers ample storage and workspace, designed with practicality and everyday convenience in mind. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, including a primary double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a private en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom is ideal as a guest bedroom, home office or single bedroom and is served by the main bathroom. Further benefits include an allocated parking space and access to the beautifully maintained communal gardens within the development.\r\n\r\nLocation-wise, it’s hard to beat. You’ve got a great selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, a supermarket, Northwood Fitness Centre, and the Crowne Plaza Hotel all within easy reach. DCU, Beaumont Hospital, the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport are all close by, while the city centre is about a 15-minute drive via the Port Tunnel. The nearby Omni Park Shopping Centre has also been recently upgraded. Looking ahead, the planned MetroLink stop in Northwood adds a nice bit of future potential to the area.\r\n\r\nService charges are approximately €2200 per annum.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of:\r\n\r\nFoyer – 3.27m x 3.84m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, spotlights and intercom system.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.15m x 3.17m\r\nBright open-plan living space with laminate wood flooring and fitted roller blinds.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 2.50m x 3.17m\r\nOpen-plan dining area with laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.41m x 2.84m\r\nWith tiled flooring, a fully fitted kitchen featuring a range of floor and wall-mounted units, tiled splashback and spotlights. Integrated appliances include an oven/grill, extractor fan, gas hob, fridge freezer and dishwasher.\r\n\r\nBalcony – 1.28m x 2.71m\r\nPrivate balcony with wooden decking.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.77m x 2.41m\r\nWith tiled flooring, half-height tiled splashback, fitted bathtub with glass shower screen, wall-mounted circular mirror, W.H.B. and W.C.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 4.73m x 2.71m\r\nGenerous double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, fitted roller blinds and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite – 2.11m x 1.46m\r\nWith tiled flooring, tiled splashback, walk-in shower, W.H.B. and W.C.\r\n\r\nSecondary Bedroom – 4.15m x 2.26m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, fitted roller blinds and built-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, furniture, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Furniture shown is for representation purposes only; please consult the estate agent to confirm what will remain in the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Vacant and no chain\r\n\r\nModern open-plan living/dining/kitchen area\r\n\r\nFitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\n\r\nOne secure allocated car parking space\r\n\r\nGas central heating\r\n\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nWithin easy driving distance to the M50, M1, and Dublin city centre\r\n\r\nExcellent cycling infrastructure with dedicated bike lanes into the city\r\n\r\nExcellent local amenities including a park, children’s playground, dog play area, and a vibrant community garden\r\n\r\n41, 33, and 16 bus routes nearby, including the 24-hour 41 service offering great value and convenience"
      },
      {
